sequenceDiagram
    actor Officer as Officer client
    actor Supervisor as Supervisor
    participant API as API / correlation middleware
    participant Auth as Authentication + ITenantContext
    participant Orch as Sequential orchestration
    participant Retrieval as Tenant-scoped hybrid retrieval
    participant Answer as GroundedAnswerUseCase
    participant LLM as Configured Gemini or Ollama
    participant DB as PostgreSQL / traces

    Officer->>API: POST /api/orchestrate/stream (query)
    API->>Auth: Authenticate API key and resolve claims
    Auth-->>API: Authoritative tenant + role
    API->>DB: Start tenant-scoped run trace
    API->>Orch: OrchestrateStreamAsync(query, tenant context)
    Orch-->>Officer: SSE RunStarted / AgentStarted
    Orch->>Retrieval: Search evidence for authenticated tenant
    Retrieval->>DB: Vector + keyword queries filtered by tenant
    DB-->>Retrieval: Bounded candidates
    Retrieval-->>Orch: RRF + reranked evidence
    Orch->>Answer: Generate grounded draft
    Answer->>Answer: Sufficiency check and bounded context
    alt Insufficient evidence
        Answer-->>Orch: Refused response; no provider call
        Orch-->>Officer: SSE RunFailed / refusal
    else Evidence sufficient
        Answer->>LLM: System instruction + query + bounded evidence
        LLM-->>Answer: Incremental completion tokens
        Answer-->>Officer: SSE AnswerChunk (partial, unvalidated)
        Answer->>Answer: Validate citations against retrieved evidence
        alt Citation validation fails
            Answer-->>Orch: Refused response
            Orch-->>Officer: SSE RunFailed / refusal
        else Citation validation succeeds
            Orch->>DB: Persist finalized answer, run and LLM trace metadata
            Orch->>DB: Create pending approval request
            Orch-->>Officer: SSE ApprovalRequired then RunCompleted
        end
    end
    Supervisor->>API: POST /api/approvals/{id}/decide
    API->>Auth: Require SupervisorOnly + tenant scope
    Auth-->>API: Authorized supervisor
    API->>DB: Persist approval decision
    Note over DB,Supervisor: Consequential execution remains blocked until approval
    Supervisor->>API: POST /api/approvals/{id}/execute
    API->>DB: Execute approved staged action and record outcome
